    "Does this patient feel driven to complete tasks or behave in a rigid, inflexible way according to specific, personal rules?":"attention a5",
    "Does this patient worry repeatedly or too much about his/her own emotional/physical state, in a way that seems excessive or inappropriate?":"attention b6",
    "Does this patient repeat the same response (e.g., word, phrase, gesture, behavior) despite being ineffective or inappropriate?":"attention b7",
    "Does this patient get mentally “stuck” or have trouble shifting thoughts or mental focus from one activity or situation to another?":"attention b8",
    "Is this patient unable to stop repetitive thoughts, urges or images that seem to cause distress?":"attention b9",
    "Does this patient act hastily or carelessly in the moment without thinking (e.g., interrupting others, trouble waiting his/her turn)":"emotion a10",
