    "Does this patient seem unaware of social cues, or speak or behave in a way that is inappropriate to the situation?":"social b33",
    "Does this patient seem unaware of others' personal space, have difficulty adapting to social situations, or act or make statements in an inappropriate manner?":"social b34",
    "Is this patient overly trusting of others, vulnerable to being tricked or manipulated, or prone to believe highly unlikely statements or claims?":"social b35"
